{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16208031","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208031","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1620803101:0":{"text":"자! 끔찍한 벌이여, 전 벌을 받을 준비가...","source_cn":"来吧！可怕的惩罚，我已经准备好——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAD3920D57F5F84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620803102:0":{"text":"어? 가디언이 없네? 밤에 도서관에 들어온 것 자체부터 이미 교칙 위반인데...","source_cn":"……奇怪，没有守卫？晚上踏入图书馆应该已经违反规定了才对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB30D96ADEB7CBF80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620803103:0":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 이건 절호의 기회야! 「연금 마법 총정리 문제집」이 여기 어딘가에 있을 텐데...","source_cn":"艾雅保佑，这是绝佳的机会！《炼金魔法总结题册》应该就在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D00A00AE259B442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804001:":{"text":"찾았다!","source_cn":"终于找到了！<key:dialog77>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44007B1F1225794A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:7:1620804002:":{"text":"어서 도망쳐야지!","source_cn":"趁现在，开溜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCA3DA7DB901620A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti